{"v":4,"catch":"拯救公主，收集花瓶！！","desc":"“ARABIAN”是SUNSOFT在1983年發布的動作遊戲。\n在古代波斯，一個年輕的阿拉伯男孩踏上了營救被俘公主的旅程。\n在船隻，洞穴和宮殿中……充分利用各種行動來收集魔術花瓶！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-10-08","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7e261fb5dc3048ccb606c5cd6d38ec445e0324b7678e801b7326d79b5c943adf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3bc4d1fa1c6b251532290afa87873dfa6001ac165b96e72c8431bab06c3ad6cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dda7facde5a64edaee43192dce4f190313d536342498fe4fbdbda37c8b1dce48.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3576db1df356f91d2e8379a7f92e653bd463c855fd887510970c42af3ceef625.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/063cf1b7a92017e6eb953e5b6075a1b58ba313d6a616ee347d76f8754e437703.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54b542cdc96b1812453f947fc4d2e34e25f21f61cbcf6fa67ee1c92586cc89b3.jpg"],"titleId":"0100cdd013178000","dlc":[]}